###


### Crear tarea en un hito existente -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hito_id": 1,
  "nombre": "Diseñar piezas",
  "descripcion": "Piezas gráficas para redes"
}

### Hito inexistente -> 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hito_id": 999999,
  "nombre": "Sin hito"
}

### Sin nombre -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hito_id": 1
}

### Sin hito_id -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Sin hito_id"
}
